I choose this college As LNCT is the no 1 Pvt college in central India for Btech especially the CSE branch of the main campus. I don't have very much idea about the ratio of faculty to students but approx 1 faculty is there for every 30 students. Every faculty has a minimum Ph.D. level degree and most of the have Doctorate degrees. The truth is all teachers have the best level of teaching experience. Term exams are upcoming...For the Main campus CSE branch, last year's fee was 1lakh 10 thousand this year's fee is 1lakh 43 thousand, if anyone wants to study in LNCT per year cost will range from 2.5 Lakhs to 3lakh per year. Last month Cisco offered 18 lakhs CTC to 17 students of LNCT. 
